This is an important milestone for ACTDRS because you're no longer just monitoring the computer. You're beginning to create a security-event pipeline.

6. Before running it

Save the file:

Ctrl + S

Then run:

python3 -m monitoring.system_monitor

Let it run for a few seconds.

Then stop it:

Ctrl + C
Important

Your normal machine probably won't cross:

CPU > 90%
RAM > 90%
Disk > 95%

So don't expect a new security event automatically yet.

That's okay.

We first need to test the automatic path deliberately.

